Subject: [PATCH 0404/3799] soh: rename func_80AAA890 ->
 EnMd_UpdateAnimSequence_StopWalking

Name source: zeldaret/oot (same decomp, same ROM address).
Body verified against upstream at 0.89.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Md/z_en_md.c.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Md/z_en_md.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Md/z_en_md.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Md/z_en_md.c
index 68d1f7676..aa82d9296 100644
